{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44677","headline":"听独杵捣衣 · 慧偘","name":"听独杵捣衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非是无人助，意欲自鸣砧。\n向月怜孤影，承风送迥音。\n疑捣双丝练，似奏一弦琴。\n令君闻独杵，知妾有专心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧偘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}